constraints:
1 <= length of nums <= 10^{2}
1 <= nums[i] <= 10^{2}

expected time complexity: O(n * sum) where sum = sum of all elements of nums.
expected auxiliary space: O(n * sum)

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def DistinctSum(self, nums):
		sums = {0}
		for x in nums:
			sums.update([s + x for s in sums])
		return sorted(sums)
